From 0ede7f2cec5c8e128784d6b2b3d80f1083bd2576 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 10:19:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] vr: cheat menu in the headset, scene note and dump list

The cheat menu is drawn into a 1280x960 render texture (ga2_cheat_menu
renderForHeadset) that ga2_vr puts on the theater screen or, in stereo scenes,
on a head-locked panel 0.9 m in front of the player. While it is open the
trigger is Circle and pointer clicks go nowhere; D-pad/stick, Circle, Cross and
both stick clicks drive it. Fixes the VR edge detection (previous state was
overwritten before the lambda ran, so only the open/close chord worked).

ga2_vrpointer::scene() lets the newer of the map's and a view's note win, so
the trigger is Cross in the cockpit from the first frame after the map.
GA2_VR_INPUT_SCRIPT times are seconds since the window opened;
GA2_VR_DUMP_AT takes a comma list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
